&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At OpenUp, we believe mental well-being should be as accessible and normal as going to the gym. Our mission is simple but ambitious: to make mental well-being available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We partner with companies to support their employees and families through proactive, practical mental health services. Our platform brings together 1:1 check-ins, courses, content, group sessions, and mindfulness practices - all supported by a dedicated network of experts. We take a holistic view, connecting mental and physical well-being through lifestyle coaching focused on sleep, nutrition, and exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we support over 1,500 companies and 500,000+ employees globally, including Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonald’s. Recognised as a Top 3 LinkedIn Startup in 2023, 2024 and 2025 - and we&#39;ve got big plans to keep growing our client-base, which is where this role comes into play.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
